{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56383","headline":"以剡牋赠陈待诏 · 陈端","name":"以剡牋赠陈待诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云母光笼玉杵温，得来原自剡溪濆。\n清含天姥岭头雪，润带金庭谷口云。\n九万未充王内史，百番聊赠杜参军。\n从知醉里纵横墨，不到羊欣练白裙。\n（见同治九年刊蔡以瑺纂《嵊县志》卷二十八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}